  "notes": "North-facing 30 \u00d7 60 ft home on two levels, laid on one line: from the front door the eye runs through the living room and a glazed passage beside a light court open to the sky, to the dining room, the kitchen and the rear garden. Stair, powder room and utility share a service strip along the west wall. Upstairs a gallery overlooks the court and serves the front master suite and the rear bedroom with its garden balcony. Preliminary concept: structure, services and approvals remain with a qualified professional.",
